WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS

Covered (written for Basalt): the Rust engines and tools (canvas-engine, search-engine, pty-helper, cli), plugins-sdk, installer scripts,
build scripts, and the files src/basalt-*.js, src/fp-canvas.js (source in canvas-engine/), src/fp-graph.js (source in graph-engine/),
src/vault-sync.js, stub/.

NOT covered: src/app.js, src/app.css, src/main.js, src/starter.*, src/help.*, src/i18n*, src/lib, src/sandbox, src/public and other files that
come from a third-party application. They remain under their original terms, are not licensed by this file, and are being replaced
(see docs/CORE-REWRITE.md). Do not redistribute builds that contain them unless those terms allow it.
